Subject: [PATCH]ipmi:ipmi_si_intf.c Fix warning: variable 'addr_space' set but not used
Date: Thu,  8 Jul 2010 12:09:55 -0700
Message-Id: <1278616195-3158-1-git-send-email-justinmattock@gmail.com>
